cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below.
title: >-
  Denominator selection bias in local genetic correlation: closed form,
  correction and diagnostic
abstract: >-
  LAVA reports a local genetic correlation only where both traits clear a
  univariate heritability filter at P < 0.05. The filter acts on the denominator
  of a ratio estimator and biases every surviving estimate. This software derives
  the bias in closed form, supplies a gate-aware correction and an applicability
  diagnostic, and validates both against LAVA's own code path across six
  psychiatric trait pairs.
type: software
license: MIT
